{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013uPHDfodKKB3BKPP6oX62Y","type":"tool_result","content":"# Full Citation\n\n**Authors:** Long Chen and Pedro Arduino\n\n**Title:** \"Implementation, Verification, and Validation of the PM4Sand Model in OpenSees\"\n\n**Report Number:** PEER Report No. 2021/02\n\n**Institution:** Pacific Earthquake Engineering Research Center, University of California, Berkeley, CA\n\n**Year:** 2021\n\n**DOI:** https://doi.org/10.55461/SJEU6160\n\n---\n\n## Additional Details\n\nThe research focused on implementing a constitutive model for earthquake engineering applications. The study involved \"parametric study,\" \"verification study,\" and \"case histories\" to demonstrate the model's capacity to \"capture realistic soil behavior,\" particularly regarding liquefaction assessment and consequences."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011wm6d9hWxbGBCfH6BoLdbY","session_id":"2e84c092-3450-428f-a602-fb47a8d85d56","uuid":"ace6c5f1-4296-496e-a205-4f1efb115731","timestamp":"2026-03-29T20:03:31.544Z"}
